+    """Answer an Ask Agy question through the tool-calling loop (MATTGPT-275).
+
+    The nonsense rules and the router's out_of_scope / personal redirects
+    still run first. The model then gets the system prompt (persona,
+    MATT_DNA, profile; synthesis voice when the router says synthesis), the
+    conversation, and the same per-answer instructions as before (opener,
